  "source_sha256": "750b22f1b79d98e5d2cfa36bce6d8b471d6b73eb9fce36895809c55ec8193737",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "29a48e6da8cf25fffeb345a50c03723f62e99e76a197e6f65addea8ddc1f61bb",
      "text": "Jade Rabbit’s\nFirst Ballet Class",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c8952249c9f37b07a33d3b214fdb8923927ff205c5cea260fa4abc8b31035542",
      "text": "Jade steps into class.\n“I want to dance!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e9510ea2343e24fd4ecc48840e99aa68c245663c404d2899eeb66c2d92739729",
      "text": "Soft shoes.\nA green skirt.\n“My ears are ready, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fb8e1910c82ca754555442bc09e2be598c1b8211764a03dfb36e79807174d19e",
      "text": "The teacher plays a tune.\n“Step with me.”\nStep, step, step.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b8cd05706001d31be8670f5eb3557e730346d893ecb8fdf82ad5143a8d030c87",
      "text": "Jade hops up high.\n“Oops! That was a hop.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8082618d822a29e6a22c1b9fea5120f4cb30ca718b97110da5a3a5f038448909",
      "text": "“Try small steps,” says the\nteacher.\nJade steps with Chang’e.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "53712ea8d4e2a568eb428a00c57fdca64e380c8aa8ee86cbba5ea78d7ad46d9a",
      "text": "Slow feet.\nSoft feet.\nThey move to the beat.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "65b83644cfc6620041b1e774061287da11e7a61b150e008fe70e90cf247a8926",
      "text": "The music stops.\nJade stops.\nHer ears keep dancing!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fcbb0e9c16179b52fb0050fad8e920ddf133dc20fae97d91f4e477843facdd12",
      "text": "“Turn slowly,” says the\nteacher.\nJade makes a small turn.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fc083ea6e974181c74a02926d2978693c796f17976393702af5e9f9236d3751a",
      "text": "Chang’e turns the other way.\n“Oh! Hello, Jade!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f3b11494bb116f1cf05fc713d161498169e4cfff95436c9f62ce52733a502011",
      "text": "They giggle.\nThey try again.\n“Small steps. A slow turn.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "28816e8e88a635701d9dc99d33ac880428d30e8fd45ac81141a2bd51986ad35b",
      "text": "Now Jade listens to the beat.\nStep, step.\nTurn, turn.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9cd42d405bade11a33f9a37bdb2065b791ad55aec3e5a61bb9d3aae92c1bb21a",
      "text": "“And stop!”\nTwo friends stop.\nTwo ears wobble.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9fc7056a152caedfe8a57d6f0b8532fc6260d9ebb5297f79b98ff6a7f012cac8",
      "text": "“Let’s dance together!”\nSmall steps. A slow turn.\nAnd stop!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d53801169837862d89b02eaf011b09ffd03c0953fa27d32f575c6c39d9eb6629",
      "text": "“We did it!” says Jade.\nChang’e smiles and claps.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7c6ec357017491f8bf65e4d6b5cb218882f09ed93b3e07c819622e3e0ebbe5d3",
      "text": "Jade takes a little bow.\nHer ears bow, too.\n“One more dance?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f14abd05c0cd0e1ecc06a7a775d666ab6e243347598fcce36a91498c2c38c0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed this story, you are welcome\nto support more. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStory and art made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
